VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url_here
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# Public site URL for auth email links (signup confirm, password reset). If unset, production
# builds use https://casacare-app.vercel.app; local dev uses the current origin (e.g. http://localhost:5173).
# VITE_AUTH_SITE_URL=https://casacare-app.vercel.app
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=your_razorpay_key_id_here
DATABASE_URL=prisma_accelerate_connection_url_here

# Auth email branding: configure SendGrid (or other) SMTP in Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → SMTP.
# Do NOT put SendGrid API keys in Vite env — they would ship to the browser. See EMAIL_BRANDING_SETUP.md.

# Edge Function `send-booking-email` (booking lifecycle): set secrets in Supabase → Edge Functions → Secrets:
# SENDGRID_API_KEY, optional SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL, SENDGRID_FROM_NAME, PUBLIC_APP_URL

# Edge Function `notify-technician-assignment` (admin assigns job → in-app + optional SMS):
# PUBLIC_APP_URL (same as above), optional MSG91_AUTHKEY + MSG91_SENDER_ID (6-char transactional sender)
